    "blurb": "Smooth migration to Camunda 8 from integration experts",
    "overview": "nterra is your experienced partner, ensuring a smooth transition from your legacy system or a previous Camunda version to Camunda 8. As integration experts, we see the big picture.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "From legacy to legendary with Camunda 8 and nterra",
    "splashDescription": "There is no longer any reason to stick with old BPM platforms: migrate smoothly to Camunda 8 without worrying about connections, functionalities or costs. With nterra, you have an experienced partner at your side who is one of the best in the DACH region when it comes to integration and migration. As a manufacturer-independent consulting partner, we have extensive expertise in common BPM platforms and their connections. We provide open and honest advice on how best to migrate to Camunda 8 – regardless of which legacy system you are currently using. Trust in our 25 years of experience in integration projects at the highest level and across all industries.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/622811/overview/img4345111972109245043.png?46dc0e9957e795bf4a9e73c7ff626610",
